rse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja473:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja473:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja473:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:11.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:11.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja473:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja473:13.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p>", "ja473:14.1": "<p class='endsection'>{}</p>", "ja473:15.1": "<p class='uddana-intro'>{}</p>", "ja473:16.1": "<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:16.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:16.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja473:16.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja473:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja473:0.2": "Dvādasakanipāta ", "ja473:0.3": "Cūḷakuṇālavagga ", "ja473:0.4": "10. Mittāmittajātaka ", "ja473:1.1": "“Kāni kammāni kubbānaṁ, ", "ja473:1.2": "kathaṁ viññū parakkame; ", "ja473:1.3": "Amittaṁ jāneyya medhāvī, ", "ja473:1.4": "disvā sutvā ca paṇḍito”. ", "ja473:2.1": "“Na naṁ umhayate disvā, ", "ja473:2.2": "na ca naṁ paṭinandati; ", "ja473:2.3": "Cakkhūni cassa na dadāti, ", "ja473:2.4": "paṭilomañca vattati. ", "ja473:3.1": "Amitte tassa bhajati, ", "ja473:3.2": "mitte tassa na sevati; ", "ja473:3.3": "Vaṇṇakāme nivāreti, ", "ja473:3.4": "akkosante pasaṁsati. ", "ja473:4.1": "Guyhañca tassa nakkhāti, ", "ja473:4.2": "tassa guyhaṁ na gūhati; ", "ja473:4.3": "Kammaṁ tassa na vaṇṇeti, ", "ja473:4.4": "paññassa nappasaṁsati. ", "ja473:5.1": "Abhave nandati tassa, ", "ja473:5.2": "bhave tassa na nandati; ", "ja473:5.3": "Accheraṁ bhojanaṁ laddhā, ", "ja473:5.4": "tassa nuppajjate sati; ", "ja473:5.5": "Tato naṁ nānukampati, ", "ja473:5.6": "aho sopi labheyyito. ", "ja473:6.1": "Iccete soḷasākārā, ", "ja473:6.2": "amittasmiṁ patiṭṭhitā; ", "ja473:6.3": "Yehi amittaṁ jāneyya, ", "ja473:6.4": "disvā sutvā ca paṇḍito”. ", "ja473:7.1": "“Kāni kammāni kubbānaṁ, ", "ja473:7.2": "kathaṁ viññū parakkame; ", "ja473:7.3": "Mittaṁ jāneyya medhāvī, ", "ja473:7.4": "disvā sutvā ca paṇḍito. ", "ja473:8.1": "Pavutthaṁ tassa sarati, ", "ja473:8.2": "āgataṁ abhinandati; ", "ja473:8.3": "Tato kelāyito hoti, ", "ja473:8.4": "vācāya paṭinandati. ", "ja473:9.1": "Mitte tasseva bhajati, ", "ja473:9.2": "amitte tassa na sevati; ", "ja473:9.3": "Akkosante nivāreti, ", "ja473:9.4": "vaṇṇakāme pasaṁsati. ", "ja473:10.1": "Guyhañca tassa akkhāti, ", "ja473:10.2": "tassa guyhañca gūhati; ", "ja473:10.3": "Kammañca tassa vaṇṇeti, ", "ja473:10.4": "paññaṁ tassa pasaṁsati. ", "ja473:11.1": "Bhave ca nandati tassa, ", "ja473:11.2": "abhave tassa na nandati; ", "ja473:11.3": "Accheraṁ bhojanaṁ laddhā, ", "ja473:11.4": "tassa uppajjate sati; ", "ja473:11.5": "Tato naṁ anukampati, ", "ja473:11.6": "aho sopi labheyyito. ", "ja473:12.1": "Iccete soḷasākārā, ", "ja473:12.2": "Mittasmiṁ suppatiṭṭhitā; ", "ja473:12.3": "Yehi mittañca jāneyya, ", "ja473:12.4": "Disvā sutvā ca paṇḍito”ti. ", "ja473:13.1": "Mittāmittajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. ", "ja473:14.1": "Dvādasakanipātaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ. ", "ja473:15.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja473:16.1": "Lahucitta sasāla kasanti puna, ", "ja473:16.2": "Atha kāma dasakhaluṭṭhānavaro; ", "ja473:16.3": "Atha kaṇha sukosiya meṇḍavaro, ", "ja473:16.4": "Padumo puna mittavarena dasāti. "}, "variant_text": {"ja473:0.1": "", "ja473:0.2": "", "ja473:0.3": "", "ja473:0.4": "", "ja473:1.1": "", "ja473:1.2": "", "ja473:1.3": "", "ja473:1.4": "", "ja473:2.1": "", "ja473:2.2": "", "ja473:2.3": "Cakkhūni cassa → cakkhūnissa (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja473:2.4": "", "ja473:3.1": "", "ja473:3.2": "", "ja473:3.3": "", "ja473:3.4": "", "ja473:4.1": "", "ja473:4.2": "", "ja473:4.3": "", "ja473:4.4": "", "ja473:5.1": "", "ja473:5.2": "", "ja473:5.3": "Accheraṁ → acchariyaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja473:5.4": "", "ja473:5.5": "", "ja473:5.6": "aho sopi → ahāsopi (si, sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja473:6.1": "", "ja473:6.2": "", "ja473:6.3": "", "ja473:6.4": "", "ja473:7.1": "", "ja473:7.2": "", "ja473:7.3": "", "ja473:7.4": "", "ja473:8.1": "", "ja473:8.2": "", "ja473:8.3": "", "ja473:8.4": "", "ja473:9.1": "", "ja473:9.2": "", "ja473:9.3": "", "ja473:9.4": "", "ja473:10.1": "", "ja473:10.2": "", "ja473:10.3": "", "ja473:10.4": "paññaṁ tassa → paññamassa (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja473:11.1": "Bhave ca nandati tassa → bhave nandati tassa ca (mr) ", "ja473:11.2": "", "ja473:11.3": "Accheraṁ → acchariyaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja473:11.4": "", "ja473:11.5": "", "ja473:11.6": "aho sopi → pahāsopi (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja473:12.1": "", "ja473:12.2": "", "ja473:12.3": "mittañca jāneyya → mittaṁ sujāneyya (pts-vp-pli1, mr) ", "ja473:12.4": "", "ja473:13.1": "", "ja473:14.1": "", "ja473:15.1": "", "ja473:16.1": "", "ja473:16.2": "", "ja473:16.3": "", "ja473:16.4": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja473:0.1": "", "ja473:0.2": "", "ja473:0.3": "", "ja473:0.4": "", "ja473:1.1": "bj30.438, csp1ed22.255, csp2ed22.255, ms22J_2368, msdiv121, pts-vp-pli4.197", "ja473:1.2": "", "ja473:1.3": "", "ja473:1.4": "", "ja473:2.1": "ms22J_2369, msdiv122", "ja473:2.2": "", "ja473:2.3": "", "ja473:2.4": "", "ja473:3.1": "dr27.339, ms22J_2370, msdiv123", "ja473:3.2": "", "ja473:3.3": "", "ja473:3.4": "", "ja473:4.1": "ms22J_2371, msdiv124", "ja473:4.2": "", "ja473:4.3": "", "ja473:4.4": "", "ja473:5.1": "ms22J_